We apply various charges to the funds you invest in through your pension. These charges will vary depending on the funds you've chosen. Please see our guide, 'How to choose the right investment options for your pension' for more information. This is available online, or you can contact us.
## Lifetime allowance charge
A charge may be collected if you go over your lifetime allowance.
## Death benefit details
If you die before retirement, we'll pay out the full plan value at the date of your death. This could be paid out as a lump sum or as a pension, or split between a lump sum and pension.
## Options available
