## Before you takeyour benefits
Review your investment choices.
Review your payments.
Do nothing and your benefits will stayin the plan until you retire.
Changing payments now may affect what your plan will be worth in the future.
## Taking your benefits
You can normally take the benefits from your plan if you are aged 55or over. Call us on 03456060012 to discuss this option further.
If you've got pension plans with a number of companies you can usually bring them together under a single plan, with Standard Life or another provider. It can make managing your pension investments easier and could save you money in charges. Check the benefits under your plans first, though, because you could lose them.
